  "about": {
    "title": "About the Hidden Fates set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Hidden Fates is a Sun & Moon expansion released on 23 August 2019. It has 69 cards: 68 in the main set and 1 secret rare. There are also 56 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 68 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (124 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 125 cards, adding the 1 secret rare).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
  },
